# 🚀 Day 40 – AI Assistant Builder

## 📌 Challenge Overview

For **Day 40** of the **60 Days Claude AI Challenge by ABTalks**, I built **🤖 AI Assistant Builder**, an interactive application that guides users through designing their own AI assistant—from defining its purpose to generating a production-ready system prompt and a premium user interface.

Instead of building a generic chatbot, this project focuses on **AI product design**, helping users create assistants tailored to specific domains, audiences, and workflows.

---

# 🎯 Project Objective

Create an intuitive platform that enables anyone to design a custom AI assistant by answering a series of guided questions, while automatically generating:

- A production-ready system prompt
- A purpose-built UI concept
- API integration structure
- Documentation for future customization

