# 🧠 AI Assistant Brain

Automatically generates a **production-quality system prompt** including:

- Assistant Role
- Scope & Responsibilities
- Constraints
- Response Format
- Edge Case Handling
- Missing Information Strategy
- Safety Guidelines

This ensures the assistant behaves consistently across different user interactions.

